WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.623
Unit thirteen. Illness from Mosquitoes!

2
00:00:04.595 --> 00:00:08.216
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.266 --> 00:00:11.394
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:15.759
Today we learn about Illness from Mosquitoes. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.258 --> 00:00:20.958
Mosquito. Say it with me. Mosquito!

6
00:00:24.464 --> 00:00:27.764
Dengue. Say it with me. Dengue!

7
00:00:31.257 --> 00:00:35.073
Malaria. Say it with me. Malaria!

8
00:00:38.586 --> 00:00:42.003
Fever. Say it with me. Fever!

9
00:00:45.488 --> 00:00:48.771
Net. Say it with me. Net!

10
00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:55.985
Repellent. Say it with me. Repellent!

11
00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:02.892
Breeding. Say it with me. Breeding!

12
00:01:06.374 --> 00:01:09.907
Prevention. Say it with me. Prevention!

13
00:01:13.407 --> 00:01:22.689
Mosquitoes can spread dengue and malaria, which cause fever. Prevention means using a net and repellent and removing breeding places like old tyres and open water.

14
00:01:22.739 --> 00:01:23.965
I can do that too!

15
00:01:25.407 --> 00:01:30.564
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.614 --> 00:01:31.764
Malaria!

17
00:01:32.895 --> 00:01:38.074
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.124 --> 00:01:39.274
Breeding!

19
00:01:40.093 --> 00:01:46.218
Did you know? Only female mosquitoes bite — they need blood to make their eggs!

20
00:01:46.268 --> 00:01:48.200
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.891 --> 00:01:56.415
Think and answer. Where do mosquitoes lay their eggs?

22
00:01:56.465 --> 00:01:57.615
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.896 --> 00:02:03.966
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:04.016 --> 00:02:06.747
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

